WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Create your account and start exploring.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:08.600
On the home page, select Create my itinerary.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.800
In the Planner, choose Create account.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:19.950
Enter your name, email and a secure password.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:24.300
Review the terms and select Create account.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.200
Check your email for the confirmation link.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:34.000
Open the ITBMO email and select Confirm my email.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.100
Your account is verified. Continue to the Planner.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:48.700
Select Start to build your route.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.000
Your account is ready. Now build your trip.

